  "solution": "**Given**\n\n[3 ÷ 5 – 8 of 4 + 3 × {8 ÷ 2 – (4 + 3)}]\n\n**Concept**\n\nBODMAS\n\n \n \n\n B\n bracket, [,{,(\n \n \n\n O\n 'OF'\n \n \n\n D\n division, ÷ \n \n \n\n M\n \n \nmultiply, ×\n\n \n \n \n\n A\n addition, +\n \n \n\n S\n subtraction, _\n \n \n\n**Calculation**\n\n[3 ÷ 5 – 8 of 4 + 3 × {8 ÷ 2 – (4 + 3)}]\n\n⇒ [3 × (1/5) - 8 × 4 + 3 × {8 × (1/2) - (7)}\n\n⇒ [(3/5) - 32 + 3 × {4 - 7}\n\n⇒ [(3/5) - 32 + 3 × (-3)\n\n⇒ [(3/5) - 32 - 9]\n\n⇒ (3 - 160 - 45)/5\n\n ⇒ - 202/5\n\n**∴ The value of [3 ÷ 5 – 8 of 4 + 3 × {8 ÷ 2 – (4 + 3)}] is -202/5**",
